                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Excellent game with charming humor and one of the rare few games that takes inspiration from the Kuru Kuru Kururin series, which is such a winning formula. It is done really well with good controls. Downsides are that it has some cringe achievements such as a desert bus recreation. Also, the ability to jump takes a bit of design intention out of the game, but otherwise it's very solid and I recommend it to pretty much anyone.",
